OL,3,AClashes erupt in Paris and other cities
OL,4,Aafter thousands join mostly peaceful
OL,5,Aprotests across France
OL,6,
OL,7,FAfter a day of mostly peaceful protests
OL,8,Facross France, clashes have erupted in
OL,9,Fseveral cities including Paris
OL,11,FIn Porte de Vincennes, in the capital,
OL,12,Fdemonstrators threw objects towards the
OL,13,Fpolice, while barricades were set
OL,14,Falight in Marseille and people ripped
OL,15,Fboards from a shop in Bordeaux
OL,17,FPolice fired tear gas in cities
OL,18,Fincluding Lyon and Marseille as
OL,19,Fhundreds of thousands took to the
OL,20,Fstreets across France - 110,000
OL,21,Fprotesters marched in Paris alone,
OL,22,Fpolice say
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
